flowchart TD

    A([Librarian Logged In])

    A --> B{Select Action}

    %% Add Book
    B -->|Add Book| C[Enter Book Details]

    C --> D{All Required Fields Filled?}

    D -->|No| E[Display 'Field/s is Empty']
    E --> B

    D -->|Yes| F{ISBN Already Exists?}

    F -->|Yes| G[Display 'ISBN Already Exists']
    G --> B

    F -->|No| H[Save Book]
    H --> I[Display 'Book Added Successfully']
    I --> B

    %% Update Book
    B -->|Update Book| J[Select Book]

    J --> K{Book Exists?}

    K -->|No| L[Display 'Book Not Found']
    L --> B

    K -->|Yes| M[Update Book Information]
    M --> N[Save Changes]
    N --> O[Display 'Book Updated Successfully']
    O --> B

    %% Delete Book
    B -->|Delete Book| P[Select Book]

    P --> Q{Book Exists?}

    Q -->|No| R[Display 'Book Not Found']
    R --> B

    Q -->|Yes| S[Delete Book]
    S --> T[Display 'Book Has Been Deleted']
    T --> U[Refresh Catalog]
    U --> B